    "text": "By Rachel Keller ,\n2 hours ago Wellness Wednesday: Your current morning routine So many common mistakes are made during your current morning routine that could be ruining the rest of your day.\nBoston 25 News Anchor Rachel Keller spoke with Dr. Jordan Barber, a chronic pain expert and acupuncturist, about what you should be incorporating into your morning routine.\nThis is a developing story. Check back for updates as more information becomes available.\nDownload the FREE Boston 25 News app for breaking news alerts.\nFollow Boston 25 News on Facebook and Twitter . | Watch Boston 25 News NOW",
